</span><span class="enc-type">Treaty · Peace · 1911</span><span class="enc-snip">The Treaty of Da'an was an agreement concluded in 1911 at Da'an, north-west of Sanaa, between the Ottoman Empire and the Zaydi imam Yahya Hamid al-Din.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-dancing-rabbit-creek"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/treaty-of-dancing-rabbit-creek.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Treaty of Dancing Rabbit Creek</span><span class="enc-type">Treaty · 1830</span><span class="enc-snip">The Treaty of Dancing Rabbit Creek was signed on 27 September 1830 in Noxubee County, Mississippi, the first removal treaty concluded under the Indian Removal Act.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-dardanos"><span class="enc-name">Treaty of Dardanos</span><span class="enc-type">Treaty · Peace · 85 BCE</span><span class="enc-snip">The Treaty of Dardanos ended the First Mithridatic War in 85 BCE.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-darin"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/treaty-of-darin.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Treaty of Darin</span><span class="enc-type">Treaty · 1915</span><span class="enc-snip">The Treaty of Darin was signed on 26 December 1915 on the island of Tarut between Britain, represented by Percy Cox, and Abd al-Aziz ibn Saud.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-delft"><span class="enc-name">Treaty of Delft</span><span class="enc-type">Treaty · Peace · 3 July 1428</span><span class="enc-snip">The Treaty of Delft, concluded on 3 July 1428, ended the main phase of the war between Jacqueline of Bavaria and Philip the Good, duke of Burgundy, over Hainaut…</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-deogaon"><span class="enc-name">Treaty of Deogaon</span><span class="enc-type">Treaty · Peace · 1803</span><span class="enc-snip">The Treaty of Deogaon was signed on 17 December 1803 between the British East India Company and Raghuji II Bhonsle of Nagpur after his defeats at Assaye and Argaon in…</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-desmichels"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/treaty-of-desmichels.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Treaty of Desmichels</span><span class="enc-type">Treaty · Peace · 1834</span><span class="enc-snip">The Treaty of Desmichels was signed in February 1834 between Emir Abdelkader and General Louis Alexis Desmichels, the French commander at Oran.</span></a></li></ul>
